OL,3,CCrews tackling 20 wildfires across
OL,4,CWales as 'major incident' continues
OL,6,FCrews across south and west Wales are
OL,7,Fcontinuing to fight 20 wildfires as
OL,8,Femergency services warn that risk
OL,9,Fremains high for next week.
OL,11,FSouth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,F(SWFRS) said on Sunday it was
OL,13,Fcontinuing to respond to the "major
OL,14,Fincident" and that crews have been
OL,15,Ftackling 14 concurrent wildfire
OL,16,Fincidents.
OL,18,FOn Friday Prime Minister Andy Burnham
OL,19,Fannounced that the military had been
OL,20,Fdeployed to south Wales to help
OL,21,Ffirefighters on the ground.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/9
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
