FL,433,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786893492
OL,3,CCrews tackling 20 wildfires across
OL,4,CWales as 'major incident' continues
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Defence have now
OL,7,Fconfirmed 200 personnel were deployed
OL,8,Fwith South Wales Fire and Rescue
OL,9,FService confirming today (Sunday,
OL,10,FAugust 16) that 110 troops remain
OL,11,Fdeployed on the ground.
OL,13,FTheir main task is to provide
OL,14,Flogistical support, such as water
OL,15,Fdistribution, and to help free
OL,16,Ffirefighters and specialist responders
OL,17,Fto focus on frontline firefighting.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/9
