CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786893492
OL,3,CCrews tackling 20 wildfires across
OL,4,CWales as 'major incident' continues
OL,6,FDeputy chief fire officer Adam
OL,7,FOpenshaw said: "The combined efforts
OL,8,Fof everyone involved in this major
OL,9,Fincident continue to play a vital role
OL,10,Fin keeping people safe during these
OL,11,Fexceptional circumstances.
OL,13,F"We know this is a challenging and
OL,14,Fworrying time for many people.
OL,16,F"Please be assured that we remain
OL,17,Fcommitted to protecting our
OL,18,Fcommunities and keeping the people of
OL,19,FSouth Wales safe."
OL,26,@oD@POUuD@AOUxD@AOU{D@RO]
