OL,3,CCrews tackling 20 wildfires across
OL,4,CWales as 'major incident' continues
OL,6,FMid and West Wales Fire and Rescue
OL,7,FService have also confirmed that they
OL,8,Fare continuing to deal with six
OL,9,Fwildfires in their force area on
OL,10,FSunday.
OL,12,FThese are in Llangynidr, Rhandirmwyn,
OL,13,FPontarddulais, Gorseinon, Llanelli,
OL,14,FTenby and Talley. The wildfire in
OL,15,FRhandirmwyn remains a "major incident".
OL,17,FOn Friday evening, millions of people
OL,18,Fin England and Wales received an alert
OL,19,Fon their mobile devices warning them
OL,20,Fof a "very high risk of wildfires
OL,21,Fnationally".
OL,26,@|D@FOU}D@KO]
