OL,3,CCrews tackling 20 wildfires across
OL,4,CWales as 'major incident' continues
OL,6,FIt came after Prime Minister Andy
OL,7,FBurnham described Britain as a
OL,8,F"tinderbox" and a temporary ban on
OL,9,Fdisposable barbecues was put in place.
OL,11,FThe transmission of the message first
OL,12,Fin Welsh, then English, sparked
OL,13,Fcriticism from some politicians, with
OL,14,FReform Wales describing it as
OL,15,F"dangerous".
OL,17,FA party spokesman said in a post on
OL,18,FFacebook: "The overwhelming majority
OL,19,Fof Wales speaks English.
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@KO]wD@AOUwD@KO]zD@KOU
