OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786893492
OL,3,CCrews tackling 20 wildfires across
OL,4,CWales as 'major incident' continues
OL,6,F"Emergency announcements should be
OL,7,Fbilingual, but English should come
OL,8,Ffirst to avoid any panic or confusion."
OL,10,FThe Welsh Conservatives also said any
OL,11,Ffuture emergency alerts must be sent
OL,12,Fsimultaneously in English and Welsh.
