OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786893492
OL,3,CCrews tackling 20 wildfires across
OL,4,CWales as 'major incident' continues
OL,6,FSWFRS said on Saturday evening that it
OL,7,Fhad already received 736 calls,
OL,8,Fcompared with an average of about 300,
OL,9,Fand urged people only to call 999 if
OL,10,Fthere was a new emergency to report.
OL,12,FSWFRS has said it believes some of the
OL,13,Fwildfires in the region have been
OL,14,Fstarted deliberately.
OL,16,FOn Friday, South Wales Police said
OL,17,Ffour 14-year-old boys had been
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of arson after a
OL,19,Ffire was allegedly set on the mountain
OL,20,Fnear Pleasant Heights in Porth.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G7/9
