OL,3,CCrews tackling 20 wildfires across
OL,4,CWales as 'major incident' continues
OL,6,FSouth Wales chief fire officer Fin
OL,7,FMonahan told BBC Radio 4's
OL,8,FBroadcasting House programme on
OL,9,FSunday: "There is a real arson problem
OL,10,Fhere.
OL,12,F"It's staggering that in our society
OL,13,Fthere are people who are prepared to
OL,14,Fgo out and not just light a fire, but
OL,15,Factually put people's lives in danger.
OL,26,@qD@IOUtD@AOU
