OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1786893492
OL,3,CCrews tackling 20 wildfires across
OL,4,CWales as 'major incident' continues
OL,6,F"This is really, really irresponsible
OL,7,Fbehaviour. If there's anybody out
OL,8,Fthere who knows of an arsonist, do
OL,9,Fplease report them to the police
OL,10,Fbecause this needs to be taken very
OL,11,Fseriously."
